	(text "V_SERVO_BEC is a pass-through actuator supply only. It has no connection to MAIN 5V, USB VBUS, or 3V3.\nFeed from an external BEC through a servo header or external distribution harness; common GND is mandatory.\nEach header contact rated 3A; PCB trace/current distribution must be designed for the actual actuator load.\nAvoid routing all servo current through one header; use external distribution for high-current actuators.\nPin3: 5V PWM or 3.3V bidir DShot by bank; pulldowns hold disconnected outputs LOW. Do not attach propellers during electrical bring-up."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 223 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b23ecacf-4067-5b74-ace7-84601ff89340")
	)
	(text "ACTUATOR CONNECTORS | 5V PWM OR 3.3V BIDIR DSHOT SIGNAL"
